 "description": "Every transaction hash in one block plus the count \u2014 the step between 'which block' and 'which transfers happened', without pulling full receipts. Costs $0.001 USDC per call. Chains: base, ethereum, arbitrum, bsc, polygon, optimism, avalanche. Byte-identical to GET /chain/block-txids?chain=base&block=latest.",
